<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.2 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.2 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for June rose 2.2 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In May, the CPI grew 2.5 percent year-on-year.  </p>
<p>From January to June, the CPI rose by 2.8 percent compared with the corresponding period of the previous year.</p>
<p> CONSUMER PRICE INDEX     June 97    May 97    June 96</p>
<p> Change year/year pct	  2.2	 2.5	  3.8</p>
<p> Index (base year 1994)    109.5     109.6	107.1</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
